    "media:imagetext": "TWAS\nTIMETABLE\nEFFECTIVE JANUARY 5-FEBRUARY 28, 1978\nTWA introduces\nRound Trip\nCheck-in.\nCheck in once.\nFly twice.\nBoarding Pass\nBoarding P/TWA\nPassenger\nYOUR\nRETURN\nBOARDING\n- PASS\nYOUR SEAT\nASSIGNMENT\nFLIGHT\n0001.\n05 JAN\nFLIGHT\n0002\n10 JAN\nTWA:\nPLEASE contact your\nflight attendant if you wish\nto change seats.\nVacant seats may already\nbe assigned from the\nnext airport.\nDESTINATION\nLOS ANGELES\nMUST be\npresented when\nboarding or\nreboarding\nDESTIN\nNYC/KENNEDY\n*EARLY CK-IN\nYOUR\nOUTBOUND\nBOARDING\nPASS\n17-9\nCOACH\nport\nexpress\nPLEASE\nPRESENT TO\nBOARDING\nAGENT.\nTWA-\nOnly on TWA",
